{
  "file_id": "3597",
  "text_count": 58,
  "dialog": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "english": "��������We've been here before, but this\nplace still gives me the creeps...",
      "_offset": 106,
      "_length": 75,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "english": "We barely made it out last time...\nare we gonna be okay?",
      "_offset": 182,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "english": "It's fine... as soon as we find\nit, we'll go back.",
      "_offset": 239,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "english": "Gyah!",
      "_offset": 290,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "english": "Sorry, sorry! Didn't mean to scare\nyou, but...",
      "_offset": 296,
      "_length": 46,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "english": "Taichi! Guys! Have you all been\nsecretly following us?",
      "_offset": 343,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "english": "More importantly, why'd you come\nback here, of all places?",
      "_offset": 398,
      "_length": 58,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "english": "Sora came back to find something\nshe lost.",
      "_offset": 457,
      "_length": 42,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "english": "What'd you lose?",
      "_offset": 500,
      "_length": 16,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "english": "Well, it's... not a big deal.",
      "_offset": 517,
      "_length": 29,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "english": "They locked Sora and Piyomon up\nhere...",
      "_offset": 547,
      "_length": 39,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "english": "Hey, Sora, did you find what you\nwere looking for?",
      "_offset": 587,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "english": "It's not in the cell...",
      "_offset": 638,
      "_length": 23,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "english": "You must've dropped it when you\nwent through the hole.",
      "_offset": 662,
      "_length": 54,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "english": "Yeah... let's check there.",
      "_offset": 717,
      "_length": 26,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "english": "Nope... it didn't fall here...",
      "_offset": 744,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "english": "I mean, what'd you drop? I can\nhelp you if you tell me.",
      "_offset": 775,
      "_length": 55,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "english": "It's fine! Don't worry about it.\nI'll find it if I keep looking.",
      "_offset": 831,
      "_length": 64,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "english": "You're not hiding something from\nus, are you? Like food?",
      "_offset": 896,
      "_length": 56,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "english": "No! I'm not like you, Taichi...",
      "_offset": 953,
      "_length": 31,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "english": "Oowoo... this is a nice bracelet!\nIt fits my white body so well...",
      "_offset": 985,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "english": "Did someone just pick it up? This\nis bad! We've got to hurry and get\nit back!",
      "_offset": 1055,
      "_length": 77,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "english": "Wait, Sora!",
      "_offset": 1133,
      "_length": 11,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "english": "Tres bien! I'll be so popular with\nthis bracelet!",
      "_offset": 1145,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "english": "A B-Bakemon?!",
      "_offset": 1195,
      "_length": 13,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "english": "W-Wait! That's what I lost! Give\nit back!",
      "_offset": 1209,
      "_length": 41,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "english": "Who are you? This is something *I*\npicked up!",
      "_offset": 1251,
      "_length": 45,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "english": "Give it back! That's important to\nme!",
      "_offset": 1297,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "english": "Then you and I can have a battle\nfor it! En garde!",
      "_offset": 1335,
      "_length": 50,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "english": "I have no idea what you're saying,\nbut I'll take it back!",
      "_offset": 1386,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "english": "The loser is moi. A complete\ndefeat.",
      "_offset": 1444,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "english": "Thank goodness... my lucky\nbracelet!",
      "_offset": 1481,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "english": "A lucky bracelet? Don't you wear\nthat when there's a wish you want\nto come true?",
      "_offset": 1518,
      "_length": 80,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "english": "It must be a really important\nwish.",
      "_offset": 1599,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "english": "Yeah... the truth is, my mom\ndoesn't approve of me playing\nsoccer.",
      "_offset": 1635,
      "_length": 66,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "english": "She's a flower arrangement school\nhead, and she'd rather I arrange\nflowers than play soccer...",
      "_offset": 1702,
      "_length": 94,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "english": "Whoa! Do you wear kimono and all\nthat, Sora?",
      "_offset": 1797,
      "_length": 44,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "english": "Don't interrupt her, she's\ntalking!",
      "_offset": 1842,
      "_length": 35,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "english": "So... my mom gave me this a while\nago. She made it with sewing\nthread.",
      "_offset": 1878,
      "_length": 70,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "english": "And she used beautiful embroidery\nthread, so I thought...",
      "_offset": 1949,
      "_length": 57,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "english": "You think if your bracelet breaks,\nyour mom will let you play soccer?",
      "_offset": 2007,
      "_length": 69,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "english": "It's not a big deal, but it's\nimportant to me...",
      "_offset": 2077,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "english": "I'm sure your wish will come true,\nSora!",
      "_offset": 2126,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "english": "Yeah!",
      "_offset": 2167,
      "_length": 5,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "english": "Huh! And I thought you were hiding\nfood from us!",
      "_offset": 2173,
      "_length": 48,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "english": "...Taichi!",
      "_offset": 2222,
      "_length": 10,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "english": "It was a joke! Don't get mad at\nme...",
      "_offset": 2233,
      "_length": 37,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "english": "Hahaha!",
      "_offset": 2271,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "english": "It must have fallen somewhere in\nthis basement...",
      "_offset": 2279,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "english": "What are you looking for, Sora?\nIf you tell me, I'll help look!",
      "_offset": 2329,
      "_length": 63,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "english": "It's fine! I'll take care of it!",
      "_offset": 2393,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "english": "Thank you... but leave it to me.",
      "_offset": 2426,
      "_length": 32,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "english": "Sora, what's wrong? You're acting\nweird!",
      "_offset": 2462,
      "_length": 40,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "english": "I'm sorry, Mimi...",
      "_offset": 2503,
      "_length": 18,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "english": "Oh! I was just a little\nsurprised...",
      "_offset": 2522,
      "_length": 36,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "english": "Okay...",
      "_offset": 2559,
      "_length": 7,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "english": "Sorry, Mimi. I'm sure Sora has a\nreason for this.",
      "_offset": 2567,
      "_length": 49,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "english": "I'll just watch for now, then.",
      "_offset": 2617,
      "_length": 30,
      "speaker_id": 0,
      "translation": ""
    }
  ]
}